{"4053210": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Xeno Strikers Hyper Squadron", "steam_appid": 4053210, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4091690], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aliens are attacking the world! Only the Xeno Strikers Hyper Squadron can repel their attack! Are you the pilot who will kick the invading forces out of the solar system?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 weapons to unlock and upgrade:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blaster - Shoots projectiles straight ahead! Can be upgraded to shoot twice, to pierce enemy shields, and to slow enemies!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burst - Rapid fire machine gun! Can be upgraded to fire massive waves and stun enemies!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Laser - Instantly zaps the closest enemy! Can be upgraded to chain zap several enemies and set them on fire!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spheres - Plasma spheres orbit the player ship! Can be upgraded to stun enemies and to knock enemies out of the skies one after another!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pulse - A powerful shockwave pulsating from the player ship! It can be upgraded to cover a massive area and to slow enemies down!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Missiles - Launches from the side of the player ship! Can be upgraded to deal splash damage, stun, and set enemies on fire!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features 5 stages with increasingly difficult enemies, each with a separate theme:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forest - The easiest enemies seem to be lost in the forest! Help them find their way out -- from the world!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ice - Aliens may be cool, but are they cool enough to withstand the frozen tundra?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desert - Too hot and inhospitable for most, but aliens still found their way here!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tropical - Usually, it's better to go to these tropical islands for a vacation, but today, there's work to be done!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >City - The final stand against the aliens, where the most powerful enemies are congregating! If the city falls, the world is doomed!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 9 different captains that start with varying upgrades. 8 must be unlocked by playing the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 difficulty levels that are progressively unlocked! Surely, only the best captains can beat all of them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And last, but definitely not least, a banging soundtrack inspired by classic 90s video games!</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aliens are attacking the world! Only the Xeno Strikers Hyper Squadron can repel their attack! Are you the pilot who will kick the invading forces out of the solar system?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 weapons to unlock and upgrade:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blaster - Shoots projectiles straight ahead! Can be upgraded to shoot twice, to pierce enemy shields, and to slow enemies!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burst - Rapid fire machine gun! Can be upgraded to fire massive waves and stun enemies!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Laser - Instantly zaps the closest enemy! Can be upgraded to chain zap several enemies and set them on fire!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spheres - Plasma spheres orbit the player ship! Can be upgraded to stun enemies and to knock enemies out of the skies one after another!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pulse - A powerful shockwave pulsating from the player ship! It can be upgraded to cover a massive area and to slow enemies down!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Missiles - Launches from the side of the player ship! Can be upgraded to deal splash damage, stun, and set enemies on fire!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features 5 stages with increasingly difficult enemies, each with a separate theme:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forest - The easiest enemies seem to be lost in the forest! Help them find their way out -- from the world!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ice - Aliens may be cool, but are they cool enough to withstand the frozen tundra?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desert - Too hot and inhospitable for most, but aliens still found their way here!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tropical - Usually, it's better to go to these tropical islands for a vacation, but today, there's work to be done!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >City - The final stand against the aliens, where the most powerful enemies are congregating! If the city falls, the world is doomed!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 9 different captains that start with varying upgrades. 8 must be unlocked by playing the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 difficulty levels that are progressively unlocked! Surely, only the best captains can beat all of them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And last, but definitely not least, a banging soundtrack inspired by classic 90s video games!</strong></p>", "short_description": "A roguelike top-down shoot-em-up! Defeat waves of enemies and level up your ship and arsenal as you move from world to world! Challenge yourself with 12 different difficulties, from a breeze in the park to tough as nails!", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053210/c82a50b7512d2fed07ec34f28d